  WHAT THIS REPORT EVIDENCES
    The test source imports javax.persistence.PersistenceException at line 63.
    That makes this report direct baseline evidence, in TEST scope, for the
    persistence API resolution decision - the last open question in the
    migration plan, resolved into a two-part action:
